#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:2
msgid "BaTiO₃の安定構造と相転移"
msgstr "Stable Structures and Phase Transitions of BaTiO₃"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃は低温では菱面体晶で、温度を上げると斜方晶、正方晶、立方晶の順に変化します。\\ この連載では、Quloudで **0 "
"Kで最も安定な構造** と **温度を上げたときの相の変化** を調べます。\\ "
"格子と原子座標を最適化し、Tiの変位に伴うエネルギー変化を調べた後、分子動力学で昇温時の構造を追います。"
msgstr ""
"At low temperatures, BaTiO₃ is rhombohedral. As the temperature rises, it"
" becomes orthorhombic, then tetragonal, then cubic. \\  In this series, "
"we use Quloud to investigate **the most stable structure at 0 K** and "
"**how the phases change as the temperature rises**. \\  We optimize the "
"lattice and atomic coordinates and examine how Ti displacement changes "
"the energy. We then follow the structure during heating with molecular "
"dynamics."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-introduction>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-introduction>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:10
msgid "4つの結晶相と分極の向きを確認し、静的計算と昇温計算でそれぞれ何が分かるかを整理します。"
msgstr ""
"We review the four crystal phases and their polarization directions and "
"discuss what we can learn from static calculations and from heating "
"calculations."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:-1
msgid "結晶構造と相の安定性"
msgstr "Crystal Structure and Phase Stability"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-lattice-constant>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-lattice-constant>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:17
msgid "4つの結晶相の格子定数を可変セル最適化で求め、実験値からのずれを手法ごとに比較します。"
msgstr ""
"We determine the lattice constants of the four crystal phases by "
"variable-cell optimization and compare each method's deviations from the "
"experimental values."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-stability>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-stability>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:21
msgid "4相のエネルギーを0 Kで比較し、各手法が菱面体晶を最安定と予測するかを確かめます。"
msgstr ""
"We compare the energies of the four phases at 0 K and check whether each "
"method predicts the rhombohedral phase to be the most stable."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-geometry-optimization>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-geometry-optimization>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:25
msgid "正方晶の格子を固定して原子座標を緩和し、TiとOの相対変位を手法ごとに比較します。"
msgstr ""
"We relax the atomic coordinates while keeping the tetragonal lattice "
"fixed and compare the relative displacements of Ti and O across methods."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:-1
msgid "極性変位と相転移"
msgstr "Polar Displacements and Phase Transitions"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-total-energy-dft-mlip>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-total-energy-dft-mlip>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:32
msgid "立方晶中のTiだけを中心からずらし、エネルギーの極小がどこに現れるかを調べます。"
msgstr ""
"We displace only Ti from the center in the cubic phase and examine where "
"the energy has a minimum."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:34
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-total-energy>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-total-energy>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:36
msgid "Ba・Ti・Oの協同変位を取り入れ、井戸の深さに対するひずみ・圧縮の影響と、Ti–O結合の電子状態を調べます。"
msgstr ""
"We include cooperative displacements of Ba, Ti, and O and examine how "
"strain and compression affect the well depth, as well as the electronic "
"states of the Ti–O bond."

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-phase-transition>`"
msgstr ":numref:`{number}. {name} <batio3-doc-phase-transition>`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/index.rst:40
msgid "昇温時のTiの局所変位と格子定数から相を判定し、3つの機械学習モデルで相の順序と転移温度を比較します。"
msgstr ""
"We use the local displacements of Ti and lattice constants during heating"
" to identify the phases and compare the phase sequence and transition "
"temperatures across three machine-learning models."

